  _id: 14201222
  _key: DIALOGUE_NODE_SIR_ALDRIC_COMPANION_ADVICE
  _displayName: Companion Advice
  _description: Aldric provides practical advice about navigating the Sanctum, avoiding
    traps and cooperating during exploration.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueSegments:
  - Keep your eyes upon the floor as well as the walls. Some of the Sanctum's traps
    are older than the Orcs who now occupy it.
  - If you find a mechanism you cannot reach or operate alone, call upon me. A second
    pair of hands may yet prove useful.
  - And when the fighting begins, do not hesitate. I shall stand beside you.
  _dialogueText: 'Keep your eyes upon the floor as well as the walls. Some of the
    Sanctum''s traps are older than the Orcs who now occupy it.

    If you find
    a mechanism you cannot reach or operate alone, call upon me. A second pair of
    hands may yet prove useful.

    And when the fighting begins, do not hesitate.
    I shall stand beside you.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: Understood.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
